    "created_at": "2016-10-10T07:31:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-10T07:31:16Z",
    "body": "> There are well-known techniques for dealing with code duplication that developers using the web bluetooth API should be able to apply on their own.\n\nI disagree. If we have the ability to make the platform better now, we should do it. One API at a time. Even if that means some inconsistency for now. I'm thinking about Promises that are not everywhere yet for instance.\n",
